# TypeScript/JavaScript Security

> Extends the common security rule with TypeScript/JavaScript-specific content.

## Secret Management

```typescript
// NEVER: Hardcoded secrets
const apiKey = "sk-proj-xxxxx"

// ALWAYS: Environment variables
const apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY

if (!apiKey) {
  throw new Error('OPENAI_API_KEY not configured')
}
```

## Review Support

- Use the **security-review** subagent for comprehensive security audits.
